OL,3,ANetanyahu names 'hero' pilot attacked
OL,4,Aon flight as passengers arrive back in
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FA pilot on an Israel-bound flight
OL,8,Fstabbed another pilot and "apparently
OL,9,Ftried to crash the plane", says Israeli
OL,10,FPM Benjamin Netanyahu
OL,12,FThe plane was travelling from Dubai to
OL,13,FTel Aviv when it plummeted 17,000ft
OL,14,F(5,200m) in less than two minutes,
OL,15,Fbefore being diverted to Saudi Arabia
OL,17,FPassengers have now arrived in Israel -
OL,18,Fone man, still wearing a blood-stained
OL,19,FT-shirt, tells Netanyahu how he helped
OL,20,Fstop the attack
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
