OL,3,ANetanyahu names 'hero' pilot attacked
OL,4,Aon flight as passengers arrive back in
OL,5,AIsrael
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe man, called Yaniv, says he put the
OL,8,Fattacker in a chokehold and pulled the
OL,9,Fplane's controls
OL,11,FEarlier, a passenger reported "terrible
OL,12,Fscreams throughout the plane" before
OL,13,F"three to five guys burst into the
OL,14,Fcockpit" and subdued the attacker
OL,16,FAnother passenger said "we took control
OL,17,Fof the flight" from "an assailant with
OL,18,Fa knife" - meanwhile, two other pilots,
OL,19,Fsitting at the back, reportedly came
OL,20,Fforward to land the plane
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
